-#
-#  The header of a finance detail PAGE (d.header): back link, the h1 with the
-#  technical `label` light and the record's `title` in normal weight, and the
-#  optional toolbar slot at its right end. One markup for every finance detail
-#  page.
-#
-#  Locals: back, back_label, label, title, toolbar
= link_to back, class: "btn btn-sm btn-link px-0 mb-2" do
  = icon(:"arrow-left")
  = back_label
%h1.mb-3.d-flex.align-items-baseline.flex-wrap.gap-2
  %span.text-muted.fw-light= label
  - if title.present?
    %span= title
  - if toolbar
    .ms-auto= toolbar
